+# UX Bible
+
+> **Draft / Non-authoritative.** `SPEC.md` remains authoritative until the controlled documentation cutover. This document stages information architecture, interaction, design-system, state, accessibility, and locale-experience contracts; it does not assign release timing.
+
+## Information architecture
+
